╭─ observation.obs-dict options ───────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Maps observation group names to lists of observation components.             │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│ Each key represents an observation group (e.g., "actor_obs", "critic_obs"),  │
│ and each value is a list of observation component names that belong to that  │
│ group.                                                                       │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│ Example:                                                                     │
│     {"actor_obs": ["base_ang_vel", "projected_gravity", "dof_pos"]}          │
│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│ --observation.obs-dict.actor-obs [STR,...]                                   │
│       (default: '['"'"'actions'"'"', '"'"'base_ang_vel'"'"',                 │
│       '"'"'dof_pos'"'"', '"'"'dof_vel'"'"', '"'"'projected_gravity'"'"']')   │
│ --observation.obs-dict.depth-obs [STR,...]                                   │
│       (default: '['"'"'cam_depth'"'"']')                                     │
